# 8-Bit Full Adder Using NOR Gates

This project implements an **8-bit Full Adder** using **1-bit Full Adders** in a structural VHDL design.

### Features

* 1-bit Full Adder using only NOR gates
* 8-bit Ripple Carry Full Adder
* VHDL implementation
* Testbench included

### Files

* `NOR_GATE.vhd` — 2-input NOR gate
* `One_bit.vhd` — 1-bit Full Adder
* `Full_adder.vhd` — 8-bit Full Adder
* `One_Bit_Test.vhd` — 1-bit testbench
* `Fulladder.vhd` — 8-bit testbench
